    <td style="font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-size: 10pt">Mr. Podgorski received a one-time grant of 78,261 shares of restricted stock under the 2016 Plan pursuant to the CFO Employment Agreement (as defined below), vesting in equal annual installments over three years beginning March 31, 2026.&#160;&#160;The amount reported in this column represents the fair market value as of the date of the grant of the portion that vested on March 31, 2026. .</span></td></tr>
